### Register Device (Admin)
POST http://localhost:3000/iot/devices
Authorization: Bearer <ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deviceCode": "DEV-SN-001",
  "deviceType": "worker_tracker",
  "status": "active"
}

### Get All Devices
GET http://localhost:3000/iot/devices
Authorization: Bearer <JWT_TOKEN>

### Assign Device to Worker and Estate
POST http://localhost:3000/iot/assignments
Authorization: Bearer <JWT_TOKEN>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deviceId": "<DEVICE_UUID>",
  "workerId": "<WORKER_UUID>",
  "estateId": "<ESTATE_UUID>",
  "startDate": "2026-10-24"
}

### Direct Ingest Worker IoT Reading
POST http://localhost:3000/iot/readings/worker
Authorization: Bearer <ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deviceId": "<DEVICE_UUID>",
  "workerId": "<WORKER_UUID>",
  "estateId": "<ESTATE_UUID>",
  "workSessionId": "<WORK_SESSION_UUID>",
  "recordedAt": "2026-10-24T08:30:00Z",
  "activityStatus": "active",
  "location": {
    "latitude": 6.9271,
    "longitude": 79.8612
  }
}

### Direct Ingest Environment IoT Reading
POST http://localhost:3000/iot/readings/environment
Authorization: Bearer <ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deviceId": "<DEVICE_UUID>",
  "estateId": "<ESTATE_UUID>",
  "recordedAt": "2026-10-24T08:30:00Z",
  "temperature": 27.5,
  "humidity": 82.0,
  "soilMoisture": 45.2,
  "location": {
    "latitude": 6.9271,
    "longitude": 79.8612
  }
}

### Check Current Cloud Fetch Configuration (Admin)
GET http://localhost:3000/iot/cloud/config
Authorization: Bearer <ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN>

### Update Cloud Fetch Path and API URL dynamically at Runtime
PATCH http://localhost:3000/iot/cloud/config
Authorization: Bearer <ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "apiUrl": "https://custom-iot-server.com",
  "apiKey": "custom_secret_api_key_123",
  "workerReadingsPath": "/api/v1/telemetry/workers",
  "environmentReadingsPath": "/api/v1/telemetry/environment",
  "enabled": true
}

### Trigger On-Demand Cloud Fetch Sync
POST http://localhost:3000/iot/cloud/sync?limit=100
Authorization: Bearer <JWT_TOKEN>
